{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There they stood all steeped in shame, another victim claimed in my name. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Murder Hotel</strong> is an interactive Murder Mystery Adventure with a huge twist: A scissors wielding demon is the murderer and you have to blame one of the human guests, forging a plausible theory how they could have done it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/0a3d84dc57890206ddbc3bedd630238c.avif?t=1756695363\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feel free to call me Gastfenger. I'm the demonic hotelier, at your service. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Oh, you want to leave already? How amusing.</i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nobody leaves this place unless I allow it. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>How about you solve 4 murder cases. Easy, you say? </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There's a twist to them. It is I who murders my own guests.</i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And it's your task to investigate and successfully blame <strong>one of the other guests</strong> as the culprit.</i><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Defeat your rival and convince the Demon Council to win a case. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lose just once, and you'll stay here, forever! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dare challenge me?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/ddfc03e40ed134aaa72e0165ca8ed9e6.avif?t=1756695363\" width=510 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are planning to add a second ending with the first major update in October.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demon may be the perpetrator but you can only explain each murder by human methods. Are you up to the challenge?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/25450726603efbaf536f062a0d64693c.avif?t=1756695363\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why the murders are happening and how to put an end to them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/c9b25836f3e8f425c03178f86f3e2e19.avif?t=1756695363\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 14 human guests and a handful of demons, all with their own backstories and dark secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/625091f13b91f39563f0e71400eb361c.avif?t=1756695363\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues in the form of paper words and form your own sentences to interrogate suspects<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/504bd814eb2b46ab9cde616c837405b0.avif?t=1756695363\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's multiple ways and theories to win a trial. Can you find them all?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/21951c985ef0c47aafffde675864b90b.avif?t=1756695363\" width=618 height=327 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/extras/682d301afad49270df5dbe68df95547e.avif?t=1756695363\" width=618 height=327 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1969170?t=1756695363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1969170?t=1756695363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/d14a6c3efe2b87053c1bd7d94942e0d3fbe1f1d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756695363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969170/d14a6c3efe2b87053c1bd7d94942e0d3fbe1f1d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756695363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains some themes that people may feel uncomfortable with:\r\n-Characters talk about an unnamed drug being used to cause amnesia.\r\n-One character briefly talks about her experience with a man trying to assault her\r\n-A character talking about losing their loved ones due to suicide linked to drug abuse.\r\n-One character telling how she pushed a man into sleeping with her, despite him not being fully okay with it due to having a girlfriend.\r\n\r\nThose topics are only very briefly mentioned and do not go further into detail."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2484850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There they stood all steeped in shame, another victim claimed in my name. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragrap